        "id": 8482
      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-01-17T21:32:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Well - a system administrator should be able to look up any credential, same as they could look up any user.\n\nI\u0027m not totally sure a project admin should be able to look these up. Would they be allowed to look up users in their project? But it needs to have a project scope because a user looking up their own credential needs to be scoped on a project.",
      "parentUuid": "7f96bb07_8d282a97",
